":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-21T18:07:30-08:00","id":1362557,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1361778-speculative-game-design-tier-3-talents?p=1361811#post1361811\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Looking forward to it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Fists of Flux on DrivethruRPG. Not sure if I can post the link, sorry if I can't.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/301201/Fists-of-Flux\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/images/4261/301201.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/301201/Fists-of-Flux\" target=\"_blank\"> Fists of Flux - Onyx Path Publishing | StoryPath Nexus | DriveThruRPG.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/301201/Fists-of-Flux\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/301201/Fists-of-Flux </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Fists of Flux - FISTS OF FLUX is a supplement covering Martial Arts in Trinity Continuum, focusing in the techniques and gifts used </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-22T00:51:26-08:00","id":1362594,"title":"","content":"Bought it a few hours ago. Work prevented me from taking a serious look at it until now. <br /> <br /> (Minor nitpick: the typos are painful. But I didn't buy it for the grammar or spelling; I bought it for the concepts and game systems. And that's what I'm judging it on.)<br /> <br /> On a first read-through, I like it! It's very much in keeping with how I envision Tier 3 paramorphs. My main qualm is that most of the Inspired Martial Artist section is stuff that I'd reserve for Powered Martial Artists: Highly Inspired wouldn't be a prerequisite for Deeper Understanding; the two would be merged. And Bending Shot, Bullet Time, and Light Steps all strike me as the sort of things that ought to be Techniques rather than Gifts. <br /> <br /> On the upside, I like the Intention Gifts, Arete, and Techniques. The Intentional use of Arete should apply to defense as well as attack (the Sumo Wrestler who refuses to be budged, for example); but otherwise, it's well thought out. <br /> <br /> I'd frame the creation of new Techniques in terms of the rules for Super-science, too. <br /> <br /> Again, those are my initial thoughts. There are a few issues I have with it; and there's no way I'd let my players use it without keeping a watchful eye on what they do with it (in particular, Time Manipulation strikes me as especially dangerous); but I like the overall approach.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-22T02:17:32-08:00","id":1362599,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the feedback and glad you liked.<br /> <br /> Please, pick all the typos you get and send me. My English is far from good and I really appreciate a proper review as nobody helped me much with it around here.<br /> <br /> I am completely open to discussion of content and the way I think about it.<br /> <br /> Thanks again!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-22T11:52:27-08:00","id":1362694,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1361778-speculative-game-design-tier-3-talents?p=1362599#post1362599\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Please, pick all the typos you get and send me. My English is far from good and I really appreciate a proper revie