ar level of typos, I will try to correct more in the weekend.<br /> <br /> Thanks again!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-22T18:24:36-08:00","id":1362773,"title":"","content":"<i>Much</i> better! Mind you, I'm only on page 7; but this time around, I think the number of typos is manageable. <br /> <br /> And congrats on Fists of Flux being the number two Hottest Community Title for Onyx Path on DrivethruRPG.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-23T18:54:45-08:00","id":1362987,"title":"","content":"Just bought Fists of Flux, really interesting, lots of fun potentials there. The way you define Excelsiors is cool, as is the way you promote a Talent to one of them (or not, as the sidebar indicates, hehe). I like the Edges and Gifts you have here. The powered Gifts are pretty interesting in what they allow one to do. The way that Techniques work is also nifty. Very mechanically simple - using the tags - but they there is sooo much open potential. The powered items chapter is pretty cool too, I like the potentials there. <br /> <br /> There is clearly some grammatical errors but in general, as a work done by a single person doing it out of passion it is a brilliant little book. So thumbs up, congrats, and I look forward to seeing further modifications, adaptations, and expansions. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-23T20:00:29-08:00","id":1362993,"title":"","content":"Just to be clear, though: although it claims to be about martial arts, what it's really about is tier 3 paramorphs \u2014 in the <i>context of</i> Martial Arts. It mentions Mundane Martial Artists, but says that there's not much to say about them because there's no need for any new game systems. <br /> <br /> I'm not disagreeing with the approach, mind you: I <i>like</i> the focus of the book. But if you're looking for a supplement that focuses on Martial Arts in general (e.g., providing more Style Edges and more Advanced Combat Maneuvers, and showing write-ups for actual Martial Arts from around the world \u2014 not just from Asia \u2014 in terms of which Styles and ACMs would best represent them), you won't find that here; that's not what Fists of Flux is about. <br /> <br /> What Fists of Flux is about is laying the groundwork for paramorphs with abilities that go beyond human limits. It's a toolkit that lets you make your own \u201cparamorph powers\u201d. <br /> <br /> And that toolkit isn't limited to making Martial Arts themed powers. If you want to make Techniques that deal with Procedurals or Intrigue instead of Action/Adventure, you can do so using this toolkit. Mind you, you'll probably need to introduce some new Technique Effects that are oriented toward Procedurals and Intrigue in order to do so; but that's not all that hard to do. <br /> <br /> There's a lot of potential here; and I'd love to see supplements for this that fully flesh out that potential.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-24T00:45:30-08:00","id":1363034,"title":"","content":"Knowing you guys liked it is great! I did my best, and in fact I am going after a proper grammar revision of the book (it\u2019s a \u201cprofessional book\u201d as it\u2019s selling for real money, so it need a proper treatment).<br /> <br /> Indeed, the book is not about martial arts, it\u2019s about wuxia, and I had to \u201cpower up\u201d the Talents to reach the intended level. After some time I had to stop adding stuff because it was getting too far, I limited to Dragon Ball, Naruto and the close related, so for sure there are far more effects that could be added and explored.<br /> <br /> I have a few more ideas for other books, but nothing really solid. Feel free to use my ideas, even copy it to your own books and build on it. It would be a great honor.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}